      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ishar directed Szeth to make a pilgrimage through the Shin monasteries.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "33" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Szeth defeated Rit and took Talenel's Honorblade.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "42" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "He found Sivi dead at the Willshaper monastery and recovered her Blade.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "45" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pozen drew him into Shadesmar to fight the Elsecaller and Edgedancer Honorbearers.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "53" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nale joined them, and the Lightweaver and Truthwatcher Honorbearers died in the next confrontation.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "72" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Szeth refused to kill his sister Elid and learned that Ishar wanted him to become a Herald.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "90" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaladin's account of the Wandersail helped Nale question blind obedience and end their fight.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "110" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nale revealed that the influence they sought to remove was Ishar himself, not an Unmade.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "119" }]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "Confronting Ishar",
          "revealedIn": [
            { "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "130" },
