          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ishar confronted Szeth with the Honorbearers reborn as human Fused.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "130" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Szeth swore the Fifth Ideal, choosing his own law instead of obedience.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "133" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaladin's Fifth Ideal healed Ishar while they were Connected.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "140" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Szeth used Nightblood to destroy the returning Honorbearers, drawing on Kaladin's Stormlight.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "141" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaladin persuaded Nightblood to stop feeding before it killed them all.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "143" }]
        }
      ]
    },
